    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44404" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sinnĭus</span></b> , ia, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the name of a
			Roman</i> gens, e. g. Sinnius Capito, <i>a Roman
				grammarian</i>, <i><span class="en">Gell. 5, 21, 9</span></i>.—Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sinnĭānus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of Sinnius</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opinio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 5, 21, 14</span></i>
			.</div>
